   =20
      [ 2645.959090] kobject '<NULL>' (ffff880059ca22c0): tried to add
    		an uninitialized object, something is seriously wrong.
      [ 2645.959104] Pid: 6, comm: events/0 Not tainted 2.6.31-5-generic =
#24-Ubuntu
