    The semantic match that finds the problem is as follows:
    (http://www.emn.fr/x-info/coccinelle/)
   =20
    // <smpl>
    @r exists@
    local idexpression x;
    statement S;
    expression E;
    identifier f,f1,l;
    position p1,p2;
    expression *ptr !=3D NULL;
    @@
