Author: Julia Lawall <julia-dAYI7NvHqcQ@public.gmane.org>
Date:   Sun Jul 19 17:26:13 2009 +0200

    HID: Move dereferences below a NULL test
   =20
    If the NULL test is necessary, then the dereferences should be moved =
below
    the NULL test.
   =20
    The semantic patch that makes this change is as follows:
    (http://www.emn.fr/x-info/coccinelle/)
   =20
    // <smpl>
    @@
    type T;
    expression E,E1;
    identifier i,fld;
    statement S;
    @@
   =20
    - T i =3D E->fld;
    + T i;
      ... when !=3D E=3DE1
          when !=3D i
      if (E =3D=3D NULL||...) S
    + i =3D E->fld;
    // </smpl>
   =20
    Signed-off-by: Julia Lawall <julia-dAYI7NvHqcQ@public.gmane.org>
