    ataflop: adjust NULL test
   =20
    dtp is derefenced on the lines above the test !dtp, and so it cannot =
be
    NULL at this point.
   =20
    A simplified version of the semantic match that finds this problem is=
 as
    follows: (http://www.emn.fr/x-info/coccinelle/)
   =20
    // <smpl>
    @r@
    expression x,E,E1;
    identifier f,l;
    position p1,p2;
    @@
   =20
    *x@p1->f =3D E1;
    ... when !=3D x =3D E
        when !=3D goto l;
    (
    *x@p2 =3D=3D NULL
    |
    *x@p2 !=3D NULL
    )
    // </smpl>
   =20
